-- CorpLang demo: variables, arithmetic, loops, conditionals, functions

BANDWIDTH x ALIGN 5
BANDWIDTH y ALIGN 10
BANDWIDTH total ALIGN x + y
PING total

CIRCLE BACK x < 8
    x ALIGN x + 1
    PING x
THANKS

TOUCH BASE total > 10
    PING "big deliverable"
OTHERWISE IF total == 10
    PING "right on target"
OTHERWISE
    PING "low hanging fruit"
THANKS

DELIVERABLE add(a, b)
    CIRCLE BACK TO OFFICE a + b
THANKS

BANDWIDTH result ALIGN add(3, 4)
PING result

FOR EACH item IN range(3)
    PING item
THANKS

BANDWIDTH deployed ALIGN LOCKED IN
TOUCH BASE deployed
    PING "shipped it"
THANKS
